// Story mode's quests: one chapter per area. Each chapter has a cast of townsfolk and a main questline you follow
// to earn your way through the wall to the boss. Steps:
//   npc    who gives the step (no npc: the task starts at once)       meet  objective until you talk to them
//   say    what they say then                                         take/give  a quest item they take or hand over
//   get    pick up n items at a place     use  touch n things at a place     fight  beat someone (`self`: the npc)
//   goal   objective during the task      wait  what they say if you come back too early
//   back   objective after the task       done  what they say when you report back (no `done`: the step ends with the task)
//   keep   don't hand the collected items over      reward {ryo, item}      open  opens the gate in the wall
// Places: plaza, house, shop, exit (town gate), gate (south gate), A and B (the two side places), road, barrier,
// and for things lying around: A, B, wild (near the road), road (beside it), town, river.

